  "title": "Creamy Almond Couscous",
  "blurb": "A simple storecupboard couscous enriched with evaporated milk powder and toasted almonds, ready in minutes.",
  "steps": [
    "Put the couscous, evaporated milk powder and chicken stock powder in a bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Boil the water and pour it over the couscous mixture, then cover the bowl with a plate and leave for 5 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, toast the slivered almonds in a dry frying pan over medium heat for 2 minutes until golden, shaking the pan occasionally.",
    "Fluff the couscous with a fork and scatter the toasted almonds over the top."
